WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The face is upside down. Something about it seems ordinary.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Turn the same image upright. Suddenly the features can feel wrong.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The pixels did not change. The orientation did.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Researchers have even tested similar effects with objects that are not faces.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
This does not prove an audio product can improve focus or change your brain.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free observation first. Then examine any claim.
